[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14733.389, "timestamp": "04:05:33", "text": "熱風槍。是的。你好。你好嗎？熱風"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14736.469, "timestamp": "04:05:36", "text": "槍。希望你一切都好。是的。  你好。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14746.11, "timestamp": "04:05:46", "text": "你好。這是怎麼回事？我正在體驗我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14747.95, "timestamp": "04:05:47", "text": "冒險之旅"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14750.389, "timestamp": "04:05:50", "text": "。所以，我們就像是在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14752.189, "timestamp": "04:05:52", "text": "尋找…"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14756.75, "timestamp": "04:05:56", "text": "尋找櫻花盛開的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14759.269, "timestamp": "04:05:59", "text": "生態環境，這樣我就可以在"}]